5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we should start by looking at the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength to ensure the human element is supported.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think it would be helpful to check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers, as well as the national computing agreement and facility day rates.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'll take a look at the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities to see how things are running!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites to identify where our timelines typically falter.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will review the closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround to assess the long-term impact of previous grants.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
